	(text "NIBBLE CARD PANEL A - FRONT PANEL, LEVELS 1: switches for A3..A0 B3..B0 and SUB..AB, their LEDs, the bus data LEDs, CF ZF CLK RST LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.5 3.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "27d22d93-6736-4f91-b289-58bf2adafcf4")
	)
	(text "Cell: 2N7000 + 47k pull-up (NMOS, see docs/gate-cell.md).  28 transistors, 48 resistors, 24 LEDs, 100 x 100 mm (docs/cards.md).\nLevel switches connect a line to +5V through 10k: a switch left on can never fight a card that pulls the line low, it only adds a 1 where nothing else drives.\nEvery switched or observed line has a 1Meg pull-down so it reads 0 when no card drives it.  BUS_i# is active-low: an inverter turns it into the data bit D_i for its LED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b03afb71-723e-4fa3-bf55-ad82fcc9cf1d")
	)
	(text "INDICATORS: one LED per bus line.  A MOSFET gate draws no current, so the LEDs load nothing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fcd17bc3-5d2d-4248-84fe-61d04fbfd3ad")
	)
